{"id":"torrey:patriarchal-government","source":"torrey","name":"Patriarchal Government","slug":"patriarchal-government","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Vested in the heads of families — Ge 18:19.","refs":[["Gen",18,19,18,19]]},{"text":"Training, &c their servants for war. — Ge 14:14.","refs":[["Gen",14,14,14,14]]},{"text":"Vindicating their wrongs. — Ge 14:12,15,16.","refs":[["Gen",14,12,14,12],["Gen",14,15,14,15],["Gen",14,16,14,16]]},{"text":"Forming treaties and alliances. — Ge 14:13; 21:22-32; 26:28-33.","refs":[["Gen",14,13,14,13],["Gen",21,22,21,32],["Gen",26,28,26,33]]},{"text":"Acting as priests. — Ge 8:20; 12:7,8; 35:1-7; Job 1:5.","refs":[["Gen",8,20,8,20],["Gen",12,7,12,7],["Gen",12,8,12,8],["Gen",35,1,35,7],["Job",1,5,1,5]]},{"text":"Acting as judges. — Ge 38:24.","refs":[["Gen",38,24,38,24]]},{"text":"Arbitrarily disinheriting and putting away servants and children. — Ge 21:14; 1Ch 5:1.","refs":[["Gen",21,14,21,14],["1Chr",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"Blessing and cursing their children. — Ge 9:25,26; 27:28,29; 49:1-33.","refs":[["Gen",9,25,9,25],["Gen",9,26,9,26],["Gen",27,28,27,28],["Gen",27,29,27,29],["Gen",49,1,49,33]]},{"text":"The authority of heads of families for, acknowledged. — Ge 23:6.","refs":[["Gen",23,6,23,6]]}],"refCount":22}
